Z||000002||Bob Englert||12-18-2000||09:34 PM||||Your best bet to find replacement parts such as these is either Ed Parks at the Fiero Factory <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html</A>  or Bob Parker at Kick Hill Farms <A HREF="http://www.kickhill.com/fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kickhill.com/fiero.html</A>   You can get their phone numbers from the web sites.<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl<p>[This message has been edited by Bob Englert (edited 12-18-2000).]||||reg||1
